This repository holds all of Glyd: the codec and CLI (src/), the store (glyd-store/), the GPU library and its kernels (gpu/), the
packer (glyd-gpu/), the Python packages (bindings/python/, glyd-gpu-py/), the inference engine (glyd-engine/), Condor (condor/) and
Starlings, the multi-machine runner (starlings/). All of it is under the Apache License 2.0.

Releases v0.29.0 to v0.32.1 were published under the Business Source License 1.1, and earlier releases under the licenses named in
their tags; the code as it is in this repository is under the Apache License 2.0.

Third-party code in third_party/ keeps its own license (third_party/README.md). The table of byte-level BPE pre-tokenizer regular expressions in glyd-engine/src/gguf_pre.rs is
llama.cpp's (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors). Datasets excerpted under benchmarks/ and research/
(evaluation questions and prompts from public benchmarks) keep their own licenses; model weights are not in this repository, and
packed models on the Hugging Face Hub carry their base model's license.
